{
  "rationale": "Use a minimal plant split into sensing and motion capability, then encode the exploration policy in small deterministic specifications. The policy favors random_walk in clear/search mode, inserts a short move_forward pulse after clear sensing to make steady coverage progress, and routes every obstacle event through a dedicated turn-recovery state. Action states self-loop on path_clear so intended one-shot controllable pulses are not preempted, while obstacle events immediately force safe recovery.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate uncontrollable perception from controllable motion with two plant automata",
    "Use one policy specification for clear exploration and directed obstacle recovery, plus one alternation specification to avoid repeated random_walk or move_forward streaks"
  ],
